  "changes": [
    "Gelato has two U-shaped trunks with six optional three-upgrade branches. All 62 saved family/tier identities remain intact; branches never gate continuation along either trunk.",
    "Twin launchers now connect to Power 6, require tray 8 and Power 6, and cost 3000 coins. Existing Twin ownership and the one-time Power-reset behavior remain.",
    "Every eligible affordable purchase uses the green purchase state, including Power rebuilds. Unaffordable and locked states remain distinct.",
    "A new U-garden v2 illustration places landmarks in reserved scenery space clear of tiles and routes. Superseded Gelato arc and U-garden v1 textures are excluded from the APK; source art remains available.",
    "A narrow checkpoint compatibility bridge accepts only the exact previous and new Gelato content fingerprints for this three-field shop change. Flight, rewards, existing builds, checkpoint schema 4 and Trial rules revision 2 remain unchanged."
  ],
  "update_compatibility": "Same Android preview package and development signing certificate as v0.6.9, with version code increased from 19 to 20. Install over the existing preview to retain package-private app data. Campaign money, upgrades, existing Twin ownership and area progress remain. The Gelato content fingerprint changes because three shop fields changed; an exact old/new fingerprint bridge preserves compatible interrupted runs. Checkpoint schema 4 and Gelato Trial rules revision 2 are retained. Physical Android installation remains for user testing.",
